Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.20,0:06:42.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《非常小特务4：时间大盗》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.80,0:00:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,考特斯特工？我是邓杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Cortez? This is Danger D'Amo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.13,0:00:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,向我报告最新情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a status update.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.77,0:00:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,视觉辨认已经完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Visual ID has been made.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.61,0:00:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标准时到达地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}The subject has entered the location right on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.88,0:00:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好所有便衣特工请注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aces. All undercover agents, be on the alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.78,0:00:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标“滴答人”偷走了航天科学局的迷你光碟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subject known as Tick Tock has the stolen OSS mini disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.25,0:00:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,1队和2队上前捉拿目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alpha and Bravo teams, move in to apprehend the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.82,0:01:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.22,0:01:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有时间炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got time bombs!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.56,0:01:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能动的是你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful what you wish for!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.27,0:01:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,“滴答人”带着航天科学局迷你光碟走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tick Tock has the stolen OSS mini disc and is on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.94,0:01:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起我不能久留\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry I can't hang around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.14,0:01:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这就带3队去4分钟后到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming with a third team. On-site arrival in four minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.31,0:01:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,等不了4分钟我用滑索下去抓他更怏\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have four minutes! I'll get him faster with the zip line.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.31,0:01:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不赶快抓到他他会定住不知多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't catch him now, who knows how many people he'll freeze?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.25,0:01:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘记了一个小细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}You forgot one tiny detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.85,0:01:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.89,0:01:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生说可以一直锻炼到临产\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, they say you can exercise up until the last day of pregnancy,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.19,0:01:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当是锻炼\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.52,0:01:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.53,0:01:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 子宫收缩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa, what was that? - Contraction!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,该放弃了你就要成为妈妈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to hang it up. You're about to become a mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.47,0:01:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才要抓紧时间完成任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the more reason to get the job done now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.24,0:01:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让“滴答人”再次跑掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't let Tick Tock escape again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.31,0:02:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.38,0:02:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别撞到公交车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try not to hit that bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.46,0:02:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 屏蔽路上的噪音 - 屏蔽中\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mute road noise. - Muting road noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.66,0:02:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呼叫威尔伯 - 呼叫中\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Call Wilbur. - Calling husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.76,0:02:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你啊还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there she is. How's my girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.56,0:02:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚下班？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just leaving work?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.20,0:02:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对只是还有些小事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, just tying up a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.80,0:02:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,怀孕9个月的人还在不知疲倦的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine months pregnant and still working around the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.84,0:02:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你恐怕是世界上最勤奋的室内设计师了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to be the most dedicated interior decorator that ever lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.58,0:02:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能说什么我喜欢我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say? I love my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.91,0:02:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.25,0:02:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打电话是因为这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's what I really called about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.75,0:02:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜猜是谁要提前来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess who decided to pay us an early visit?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.22,0:02:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,要生了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.15,0:02:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在去医院的路上到那里见面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on my way to the hospital. Meet me there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.06,0:02:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对医院别慌我这就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Hospital. Don't panic. I'm here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.53,0:02:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you have to do…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.33,0:02:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,平缓呼吸经常呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is breathe easy and breathe often…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.57,0:02:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and take it nice and slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.04,0:02:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you so… much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.18,0:03:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.01,0:03:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不会有事的 - 知道了到医院见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're gonna be just fine. - Yep. Gotcha. See you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.13,0:03:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,特工你就要生了等待后援吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent, you're ready to pop. Wait for backup!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.26,0:03:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,子宫收缩只相隔3分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Contractions are only three minutes apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.20,0:03:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.11,0:03:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了滴答人把迷你光碟交出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, Tick Tock. Hand over the mini disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.25,0:03:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这次不会 - 天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not this time. - Ah, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.92,0:03:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别低估她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't underestimate her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.02,0:03:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像我的羊水破了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think my water just broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.79,0:03:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来是别人尿裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope that was my water.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.13,0:03:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,打败她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clean her clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.84,0:04:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让着点我正子宫收缩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut me some slack, I'm having a contraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.04,0:04:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.59,0:04:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望再有下次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look forward to doing this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.26,0:04:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好考特斯特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swell work, Agent Cortez.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.46,0:04:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮我就知道你能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aces. I knew you had it in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.93,0:04:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果光碟到了坏人手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this got into the wrong hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.07,0:04:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界将会停止运转\N{\fnArial\fs30}our world would've stopped in its tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.71,0:04:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是航天科学局的资料片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like an old OSS file.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.01,0:04:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,末日计划终极武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Project Armageddon, the ultimate weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.78,0:04:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种武器不光能消灭敌人也能消灭所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This baby not only takes out your enemy, it takes out everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.01,0:04:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有时间没了人们才能注意到时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one ever notices time until it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.16,0:04:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was our agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.06,0:04:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一次任务之后我就永远退出\N{\fnArial\fs30}One last mission and I'm out for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.66,0:05:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的要辞职？抛下我们不管了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're really gonna take a powder on us? Leave us high and dry?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.30,0:05:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不能吊在滑索上或者汽车追逐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more dangling from zip lines or high-speed chases.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.97,0:05:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家人现在需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family needs me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.67,0:05:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让他们知道我是间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they can never know I was a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.50,0:05:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尊重这一点但是给你一条建议：告诉他们你的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}I respect that, agent. But a word of advice: tell 'em who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.81,0:05:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,人生短暂不要有那么多秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life's too short for secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.34,0:05:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我们生一个神通广大的孩子好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push out a good one, a nice little fire-breather for us, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.28,0:05:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,航天科学局的未来全系于此\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future of the OSS depends on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.38,0:05:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要干站着嚼口香糖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's not stand around bumping gums, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.59,0:05:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想弄明白是什么让滴答人滴答\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna figure out what makes Tick Tock tick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.96,0:05:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,拇指搏斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thumb battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.56,0:05:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.53,0:05:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们我想到一个新的真人秀节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kids. I got a new idea for a reality show.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.73,0:05:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,名叫威尔伯：间谍猎手\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called Wilbur Wilson: Spy Hunter,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.34,0:05:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,在电视上追捕真正的间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}where I hunt real spies on TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.17,0:05:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们觉得怎么样 - 挺不错的爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you think? - Uh, it's pretty out there, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打败你了 - 漂亮的击倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got you. - Nice takedown.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.61,0:05:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢了一次你去哪里找间谍呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}one point for me. Yeah, I mean, where are you gonna find a spy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.95,0:05:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨老公 - 嗨亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi! Honey! - Hey, sweetheart!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.25,0:05:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you look great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.02,0:06:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你输给我一块钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe me a dollar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.66,0:06:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道能比她来的更早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you we would get here before her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.03,0:06:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过不着急但是我们等了一个晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said take it slow, but that was a night shy of eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.06,0:06:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一个早上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a morning past forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.46,0:06:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,继母干什么事都迟到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stepmother is always late for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.03,0:06:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,严格来说我是来早了因为预产期本来是明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technically I'm early, 'cause the baby wasn't even due until tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.94,0:06:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ease up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.10,0:06:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么现在才来\N{\fnArial\fs30}What took so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.57,0:06:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃只是忘了时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, just must have lost track of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.41,0:06:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, God! - Here we go! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.78,0:06:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,天你们看你们看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeez! Guys, guys, guys, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.05,0:06:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在起一切都将变得不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}From this point on, everything'll be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.58,0:06:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的不同吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a good way, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.32,0:06:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的你会有一个妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. And you'll have a new baby sister…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.49,0:06:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒计时5 4 3 2…\N{\fnArial\fs30}in five, four, three, two…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.88,0:06:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每次寻找\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put my life on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.14,0:06:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们身边的间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}every time I search for…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.95,0:07:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是冒着生命危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the spies among us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.52,0:07:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.62,0:07:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是威尔伯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Wilbur Wilson…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.82,0:07:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,间谍猎手\N{\fnArial\fs30}… Spy Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.49,0:07:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,每周一晚黄金时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mondays after your local news.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.00,0:07:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一片熏肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last piece of bacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.00,0:07:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.37,0:07:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.81,0:07:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝宝又甩食物了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the baby throwing food again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.31,0:07:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.51,0:07:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们照看一下她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you watch her, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去再换换衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go change again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.78,0:07:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,再一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.68,0:07:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.65,0:07:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的屁能把家里的油漆熏得脱落下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her gas bombs are gonna take the paint right off this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.92,0:07:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你照看她 - 不 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You watch her. - No. You.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.06,0:07:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来场憋气大赛？- 来就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Breath-holding contest? - You're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.17,0:07:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢了一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}one point for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.50,0:07:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早上好小间谍猎手 - 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning, little Spy Hunters. - Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.07,0:07:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有时间和我们一起吃早餐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have time to eat breakfast with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.80,0:07:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然有 - 好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I sure do. - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.81,0:08:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.94,0:08:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓就在刚才\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear I had an extra five minutes…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.48,0:08:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有5分钟的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}…just a few minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.38,0:08:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 时间去哪儿了 - 我说过他不会有时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where'd the time go? - Told you he wouldn't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.29,0:08:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你输给我一块钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe me a dollar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.59,0:08:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得我们的五年计划吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey… Do you remember our five-year plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.09,0:08:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我的节目顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}If my show does well,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.89,0:08:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我就会有无数的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I'll have all the time in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.76,0:08:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,来陪着你和你\N{\fnArial\fs30}to spend with you and you, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.63,0:08:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时时间却在溜走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meanwhile, time is just slipping away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.77,0:08:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早上好老公 - 再见老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morning, honey. - Oh, bye, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.00,0:08:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要去上班了 - 呃好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I gotta get to work. - Oh, um, OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.91,0:08:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 送别拥抱？- 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, good-bye hug? - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.91,0:08:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.22,0:08:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye. - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.35,0:08:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丽贝卡在学校要乖知道吗 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rebecca, behave at school. OK? - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.72,0:08:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 塞西尔… - 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And, Cecil. - Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.15,0:08:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,要喂狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}…feed the dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.59,0:08:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,它并不吃饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't really eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.42,0:08:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是看着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just watches us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.29,0:08:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,给阿格诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, Argonaut.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.53,0:08:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺古怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.50,0:09:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最担心的事发生了时间加速了\N{\fnArial\fs30}our worst fear has happened: Time is speeding up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.77,0:09:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不是吓唬我的吧这是真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not cranking my chain, are you? This is on the up and up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.01,0:09:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚上好先生 - 晚上好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good night, sir. - Good night?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.48,0:09:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡说什么美女你刚吃完午饭回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about, doll face? You just got back from lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.35,0:09:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可现在是五点 - 五点？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But it's five o'clock, sir. - Five o'clock?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.92,0:09:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,末日装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Armageddon device.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.99,0:09:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.03,0:09:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拿花生果酱三明治蒙住你的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he put a peanut butter and jelly sandwich in your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.66,0:09:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后偷走了你的作业？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then he stole your homework?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.43,0:09:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,严格来说是他的作业我只是替他做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technically, it was his homework. I was just doing it for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.40,0:09:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢丽贝卡今天过得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about you, Miss Rebecca? How was your day?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.67,0:09:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,和以往一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same old, same old.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.24,0:09:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.91,0:09:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,校长打电话给我说起你的恶作剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The principal called me about your pranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.11,0:09:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 孩子们 - 爸爸坐在我身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, kids! - Dad! Come, sit by me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.32,0:09:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起孩子们我要先把报告写完才能去干别的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, kids, but I have to go write up this report before I can do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我留点剩饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save me some leftovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.89,0:09:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂爸爸你能教我怎么做间谍猎手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dad? Can you teach me how to be a Spy Hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.36,0:09:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事总是有时间的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's always time for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.46,0:10:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好跟着我重复\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. Repeat after me:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.46,0:10:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是西塞尔间谍猎手\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'm Cecil Wilson, Spy Hunter,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.23,0:10:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等会就抓住你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll catch you… later."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.60,0:10:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是西塞尔间谍猎手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Cecil Wilson, Spy Hunter,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.34,0:10:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等会就抓住你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll catch you… later!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.01,0:10:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,重要的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the important part.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.38,0:10:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,扬起眉毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lift the eyebrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.12,0:10:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊重金拱门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Respect the golden arch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.35,0:10:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的秘诀\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.39,0:10:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抓住多少间谍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many spies have you caught?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.32,0:10:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…一个也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um… Well, none.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.73,0:10:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这不是节目的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um… But that's not really what the show's about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.46,0:10:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说你不是抓间谍的超级英雄？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're not a spy-catching superhero?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.00,0:10:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前还不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not yet…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.57,0:10:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.10,0:10:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,小宝宝怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's my girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.24,0:10:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她今天大便两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}She made two poopies today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.17,0:10:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,两次？离我的记录只差6次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two poopies? She's six away from the house record.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.08,0:10:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.31,0:10:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要流鼻涕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, don't get snotty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.62,0:10:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有食欲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost my appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.29,0:11:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去和她谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.99,0:11:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做错什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I doing wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.06,0:11:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽力和她交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've tried so hard to connect with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.40,0:11:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可她就是恨我 - 她不恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But she just hates me. - No, she doesn't hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.33,0:11:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他绝对恨我 - 不是的也许有一点点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She totally hates me. - No, she doesn't. Maybe a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.00,0:11:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开玩笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kidding, I'm kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.60,0:11:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是还没有适应家里的变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she's just trying to adjust to a new situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.71,0:11:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们结婚都两年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been married for two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.91,0:11:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.08,0:11:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从有了继母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's had less time for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.88,0:11:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸陪我们的时间就少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}ever since Stepmother entered the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.82,0:11:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还有事瞒着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she's keeping something from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.92,0:11:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感觉到她有秘密身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel it. She's not who she says she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.09,0:11:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得她不是室内设计师？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think she's really an interior decorator?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.59,0:11:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看家里的的装饰她显然是个坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look at this place! She's obviously evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.73,0:11:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得她挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think she's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.54,0:11:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有事瞒着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is something she's hiding from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.64,0:11:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也不能对她用蓝色奶酪炸弹啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't mean she deserves your blue cheese dressing bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.64,0:11:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最好的恶作剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}My best prank yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.48,0:11:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的听觉不行使我别的感觉敏锐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not hearing very well increased my other senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.31,0:12:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如嗅觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.05,0:12:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心反正她从来不进我的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, she never comes into my room anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.89,0:12:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有时间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.35,0:12:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.26,0:12:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在地下室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was going through the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.03,0:12:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到一样东西你可能想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I found some things that I thought you might wanna have.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.50,0:12:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.47,0:12:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想她我永远替代不了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you miss your mom and I could never replace her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.78,0:12:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们能做朋友我会很高兴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just would really like it if maybe we could be friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.48,0:12:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈经常说她喜欢我的恶作剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom always said she loved my practical jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.59,0:12:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的恶作剧我觉得你十分有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love your practical jokes. I think you're hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.82,0:12:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我有趣？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.22,0:12:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上个月捉弄你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one you did last month to your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.46,0:12:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,把蓝莓浆掺进牙膏里\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you filled his toothpaste with blueberry filling?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.73,0:12:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的牙齿蓝了四天\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his teeth were blue for like four days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.37,0:12:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,太厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was epic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.30,0:12:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那次我把他的鼻子剃须刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how about the time I hooked up his nose hair clipper.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.14,0:12:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,连到电锯上\N{\fnArial\fs30}to a power saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.97,0:12:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的杰作之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of my best work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.94,0:13:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有把婴儿爽身粉放进吹风机里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the baby powder in the hair dryer trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.85,0:13:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那本来是捉弄你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had meant that prank for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.38,0:13:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.62,0:13:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.62,0:13:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系只是个玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK. It was just a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.79,0:13:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有件东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.09,0:13:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想送给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I would like you to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.26,0:13:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我像你这么大的时候我父母送给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is something my parents gave me when I was around your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.90,0:13:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈说它会永远保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my mother said it would always protect me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.97,0:13:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便是在最黑暗的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}even in my darkest hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.94,0:13:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得她的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I think she meant by that was,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.98,0:13:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会永远的到她的爱和支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would always have her love and support.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.35,0:13:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真要送给我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're really giving this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.45,0:13:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,它对我和我的家庭来说很特殊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's something that's very special to me and my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.35,0:13:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想送给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I want you to have it…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.89,0:13:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是如此特殊\N{\fnArial\fs30}…because you're so very special.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.03,0:13:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽贝卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.26,0:14:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很期待我们成为朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm really looking forward to us being friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.80,0:14:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.74,0:14:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.72,0:14:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽萨等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marissa, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.70,0:14:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.50,0:14:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,真对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}…sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.18,0:14:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good going.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.35,0:14:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想告她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to warn her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.05,0:14:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要和她和解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to make it up to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.82,0:14:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么老是我道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do I have to be the one to always apologize?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.32,0:14:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如那次你一直说话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what about that time that you just kept on talking and I was…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.49,0:14:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我关闭了我的助听器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I turned off my hearing aids.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.77,0:15:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧我和她和解\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK! I'll make it up to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.24,0:15:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.74,0:15:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,节目的名字叫做“间谍猎手”\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the show is called Spy Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.14,0:15:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总要捉住一个间谍才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}At some point, I should actually catch a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.81,0:15:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得我很没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks I'm a complete loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.95,0:15:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是这个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what he meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.75,0:15:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只想能多点时间和你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just wanna spend more time with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.15,0:15:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.79,0:15:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝宝又吐在你身上了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, did the baby spit up on you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.49,0:15:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 重要新闻… - 差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In breaking news… - Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.19,0:15:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最担心的情况得到了证实\N{\fnArial\fs30}…our worst fears have been confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.80,0:15:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,据科学家所说每天的时间更少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to scientists, there are now, literally, less hours in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.10,0:15:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,研究表明时间在消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Studies show that time is running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.47,0:15:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间在加速\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time is speeding up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.60,0:15:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始我们失去的只是一瞬可现在我们正失去几个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}At first, we were losing nanoseconds, but now we 're losing hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.61,0:15:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,到明天我们会失去几天到后天我们会失去一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}By tomorrow, we'll have lost days. By the day after that, a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.11,0:15:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,以这个速度我们很快就没有时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}At this rate, we will be completely out of time… in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.01,0:15:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,专家对引起这一现象的原因莫衷一是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Experts are divided on what's causing this phenomenon,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.68,0:16:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过有一个人宣称对此事负责这是我们刚刚收到的录像\N{\fnArial\fs30}although one man has claimed credit. We received this video moments ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.82,0:16:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界公民们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Citizens of the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.99,0:16:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我判决你们全部犯有浪费时间的罪名\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find you all guilty of wasting time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.96,0:16:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间都花在无谓的追求上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fill your days with meaningless pursuits.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.10,0:16:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是珍惜和你爱的人在一起的时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}instead of treasuring moments with those you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.44,0:16:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间不再是你们轻易得到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will no longer take time for granted,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.21,0:16:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要剥夺你们所有的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}for I am taking all of the time in the world from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.35,0:16:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,末日计划已经启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Project Armageddon has been activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.32,0:16:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会继续加快时间直到耗尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will continue to speed up time until time runs out,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.79,0:16:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界将会结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the world will end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.69,0:16:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是时间守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the Time Keeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.26,0:16:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要更多的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I want more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.73,0:16:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,几分钟前航天科学局局长邓杰对此发表评论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only minutes ago, OSS Director Danger D'Amo addressed the threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.37,0:16:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,航天科学局将会找到这个时间守护者等找到了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The OSS will find this Time Keeper, and when we do,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.21,0:16:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会打烂他的时钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will punch his clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.04,0:16:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在每小时减少一分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a decrease of one minute per hour as now…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.38,0:16:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,滴答人逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tick Tock has escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.21,0:17:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,大事不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.71,0:17:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实这是大好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, this is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.52,0:17:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能采访这个时间持有者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you imagine the promotion I would get.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.45,0:17:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会得到多大的升职啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I landed an interview with this guy, the Time Holder?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.42,0:17:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 时间守护者 - 而且抓住国际大坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Time Keeper. - Not to mention the hero factor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.62,0:17:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的英雄形象就建立起来了我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}for tracking down an international supervillain. Not too shabby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.36,0:17:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,老公我觉得孩子们现在需要的不是你做英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, I think being a hero isn't really what the kids need from you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.06,0:17:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这正是他们现在需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just what they need now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.50,0:17:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是世界需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what the world needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.91,0:17:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我承诺的时间宝石呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the Chronos Sapphire you promised me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.04,0:17:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间不等人但会等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time waits for no man, no man but me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.35,0:17:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那颗宝石是唯一可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one little rock is the only element.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.35,0:17:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止末日装置的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}that can stop the Armageddon device.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.15,0:17:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我会到我们手上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, it will be ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.59,0:17:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间和我的耐心都不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time and my temper are short.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.99,0:17:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你如果浪费我的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You waste my time…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.16,0:17:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I'll waste you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.93,0:17:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will find the Chronos Sapphire…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.67,0:17:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and when we do…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.17,0:18:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能阻止我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}…no one will be able to stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.21,0:18:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.29,0:18:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好宝贝女儿你困了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, princess. You're a little sleepy head, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.89,0:18:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.60,0:18:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,航天科学局指示：只能你看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}OSS directive. For your eyes only.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.37,0:18:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间守护者的威胁被确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time Keeper threat confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.47,0:18:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要时间宝石来阻止末日装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chronos Sapphire needed to stop Armageddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.31,0:18:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上把时间宝石送到航天科学局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deliver Chronos to OSS immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.95,0:18:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦丽贝卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.88,0:18:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你在研究怎么道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you're working on that apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.45,0:18:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要注明一句：这不关西塞尔的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure you write "P.S., Cecil is innocent."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.12,0:18:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,手工做的优惠券\N{\fnArial\fs30}A handmade coupon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.59,0:18:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以一个月不用做家务活\N{\fnArial\fs30}good for one free month of all household chores.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.59,0:18:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及一个月内不发生恶作剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no pranks for a whole month.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.19,0:18:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及一周内不发生恶作剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And no pranks for a week."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.10,0:19:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂丽贝卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Rebecca?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.24,0:19:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚的项链还在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have that necklace from last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.47,0:19:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.81,0:19:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问问我能不能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just wondering if maybe I could, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.38,0:19:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,要回来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…maybe I can have it back?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.74,0:19:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要回项链？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want the necklace back?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.91,0:19:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想清洗一下因为很旧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I realized it needs to be cleaned, and, uh… you know, it's old.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.85,0:19:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了交给我你不放心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I get it. You can't trust me with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.29,0:19:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说这项链很特殊我也很特殊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to "This necklace is so special, and so are you"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.49,0:19:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来这不是你的真心话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I supposed to pretend that you really meant that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.43,0:19:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要要回项链现在无法解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need the necklace back. I can't really explain it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.87,0:19:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.07,0:19:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我不稀罕你的破项链\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never wanted your stupid necklace anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.37,0:19:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只关心自己从来不关心我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You only care about yourself! You don't care about us at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.98,0:19:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一个重要任务不事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go on an important mission, I mean, errand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.42,0:19:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰箱里有点心\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are snacks in the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.99,0:19:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我1 0分钟后回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back in ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.39,0:20:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们需要什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you guys need anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.96,0:20:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.27,0:20:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.20,0:20:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.04,0:20:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿格诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Argonaut.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.54,0:20:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.79,0:20:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,房子武装完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}House is now armed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.39,0:20:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,系好安全带宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buckle up, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.50,0:20:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宝宝安全 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Baby secure. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.37,0:20:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开车走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go for a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.14,0:20:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂你不是还给玛丽莎了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! I thought you gave that back to Marissa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.91,0:20:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着她看到盒子里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait till she looks in the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.15,0:20:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回来特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back, agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.98,0:20:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是时间宝石吗没有它我们就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that the Chronos Sapphire? Without that, our goose is cooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.55,0:21:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,给妈妈谢谢宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it to Mommy. Thank you, pumpkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.36,0:21:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,来给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.93,0:21:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.66,0:21:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一出恶作剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another prank.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.57,0:21:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宝宝的饭 - 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Baby food. - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.30,0:21:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的女儿心情不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}My stepdaughter is a little… upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.51,0:21:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,项链在她那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has the necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.87,0:21:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去要回来 - 时间宝石可以等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can get it back. - Chronos Sapphire can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.68,0:21:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的老对手滴答人逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your old pallie Tick Tock has just been made.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.54,0:21:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是唯一能抓住他的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're the only one that can scoop him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.98,0:21:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又回来工作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pop the clutch. You're back on the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.12,0:21:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管时间宝石了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the Chronos?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.65,0:21:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抓住滴答人就能找到时间守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You nab Tick Tock, he'll lead us to the Time Keeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.15,0:21:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要时间宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need the Chronos.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.72,0:21:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么丽贝卡可以留着项链\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Rebecca can keep the necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.32,0:21:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那对她是个很大的安慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would mean a lot if she could.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.43,0:21:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好我干我要先去找到孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. I'll do it. I just have to go get my kids first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.80,0:21:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些小家伙不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those ankle biters'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.90,0:21:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是1 7号探索者我们锁定了时间宝石的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Seeker 17. We have a lock on the Chronos Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.21,0:21:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复我们找到了时间宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat, we have found the Chronos Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.68,0:21:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备破门而入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare to breach the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.12,0:22:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really shouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.02,0:22:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你一定要干让她长上吸血鬼的牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you're going to, give her vampire teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.76,0:22:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告家里即将遭到攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warning, residence subject to immediate attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.20,0:22:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻到恐慌房间躲避\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please take shelter in the panic room now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.80,0:22:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的恶作剧水平越来越高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're really stepping up your game with these pranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.90,0:22:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我的恶作剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not my prank.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.27,0:22:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告家里即将遭到攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warning, residence subject to immediate attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.41,0:22:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻到恐慌房间躲避\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take shelter in the panic room now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.91,0:22:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 恐慌房间在哪儿 - 别上当\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's the panic room? - Don't fall for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.01,0:22:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这显然是玛丽萨在讨好我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is obviously Marissa's attempt to get me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.88,0:22:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻到恐慌房间躲避\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take shelter in the panic room now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.12,0:22:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不去的话难道还能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and if we don't, I suppose something really terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.32,0:22:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生可怕的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}will happen to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.26,0:22:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,扫描中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scanning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.47,0:22:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,扫描中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scanning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.63,0:22:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,身份确认请立刻进入恐慌房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Identity match. Please enter the panic room now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.78,0:23:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 立刻进入恐慌房间 - 走吧丽贝卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Enter the panic room now. - Let's go, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.28,0:23:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻进入恐慌房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enter the panic room now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.46,0:23:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里显然就是恐慌房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is obviously the panic room.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.03,0:23:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么 - 因为这是个房间我又在恐慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - 'Cause it's a room, and I'm panicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.87,0:23:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, children.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.47,0:23:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我嫁给你们父亲的时候设置了这个恐慌房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had this panic room installed when I married your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.47,0:23:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,以备我的工作使得家人受到威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the event that my work ever put the family in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.08,0:23:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的工作？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her work?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.51,0:23:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有件事我从未告诉你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something I never told you about myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.31,0:23:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这关系到国家安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}because it was a matter of national security.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.98,0:23:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.68,0:23:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的继母是间谍？\N{\fnArial\fs30}our stepmother's a spy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.62,0:23:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.16,0:23:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没那个派头\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not cool enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.10,0:23:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿格诺是先进的守护者机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Argonaut is an Advanced Robotic Guardian Operative.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.20,0:23:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,用于守护你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}designed to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.80,0:24:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仍然觉得这是个恶作剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still think this is a prank.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.30,0:24:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是恶作剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a prank.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.81,0:24:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗在说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dog is talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.24,0:24:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我注意到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.54,0:24:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你们想看到的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's not the sort of thing you'd miss, is it, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.01,0:24:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个漂亮的小狗用英国口音说话就像007\N{\fnArial\fs30}A small, handsome dog talking with an English accent, like James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.82,0:24:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之我的任务是保护你们来击个掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I've been assigned to protect you, so give me five.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.40,0:24:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是很酷的做法吧握握手也行\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what cool people say, isn't it? Anyway, let's shake hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.73,0:24:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. How do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.87,0:24:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不我不喜欢这样需要你还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Oh, no! I hate when that happens! I am gonna need that back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.24,0:24:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哨兵模式？攻击模式？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sentry mode? Attack mode?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.91,0:24:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是保持在哨兵模式吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you better keep it in sentry mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.34,0:24:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,放回去越快越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pop it back on, any time you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.98,0:24:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有道理 - 说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good thinking. - No, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.08,0:24:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,放回去吧我要摔倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I have it back now? 'Cause I am gonna fall over.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.23,0:24:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐慌房间受到攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}The panic room is being attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.06,0:25:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们必须离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.30,0:25:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,喷气式雪橇将会带你们到航天科学局总部\N{\fnArial\fs30}The jet luges will take you to OSS headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.17,0:25:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下搞笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sit. Do you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.20,0:25:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般是人让狗坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what humans usually say to dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.90,0:25:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我颠倒过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I reversed it, I flipped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.11,0:25:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一路会很愉快的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is gonna be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.28,0:25:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你们我们将会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you, we're gonna have a…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.68,0:25:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一般吃了草或者拖鞋才会这么反胃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I usually have to eat grass or a slipper to feel this sick. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.09,0:25:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是还没适应过来没事没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't ready, that's all. I'm fine, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.57,0:25:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要让时间宝石跑掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not let the Chronos Sapphire get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.95,0:25:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,微型摄像头也没什么稀奇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mini camera is not that impressive anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.02,0:25:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的人骨头上都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}People have them in their phones.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.62,0:26:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how small is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.22,0:26:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不可能 - 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's impossible. - Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.33,0:26:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.36,0:26:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸帮帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.06,0:26:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起我身后有飞行表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, there was an air show behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.13,0:26:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能存在隐形粉末\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no such thing as invisibility powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.67,0:26:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好阿格诺说话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Argonaut. Start talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.40,0:26:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些戴着护目镜的人是谁为什么来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who were those guys with the giant goggles? What do they want?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.44,0:26:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽萨做间谍多长时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long has Marissa been a spy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.04,0:26:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们继母完成任务之后会回答你们的全部问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. Your stepmom will answer all of your questions post-mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.24,0:26:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个问题谁在驾驶这种飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a question. Who's flying this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.98,0:26:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.28,0:26:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕他们好像来者不善\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. They do not look like pet lovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.32,0:26:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们好看到这个说明你们的喷气飞机正受到攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, children. If you're watching this, your escape jets are under attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.86,0:26:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须采用躲避动作\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are going to have to initiate evasive maneuvers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.09,0:26:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你们更快到达航天科学局总部\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get you to OSS even faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.46,0:26:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坐稳了 - 惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Brace yourselves. - Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.67,0:26:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像电子游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a big video game.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.17,0:26:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,握住控制杆稳稳地驾驶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab your controller and steer slowly!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.87,0:26:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇 - 我要坠机了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa! - I'm gonna crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.58,0:27:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想吐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna hurl.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.98,0:27:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,吐在袋子里不要沾到我的毛上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Puke goes in the bag, not on my fur.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.99,0:27:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们靠近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gaining!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.07,0:27:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞西尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cecil!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.24,0:27:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,做点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.97,0:27:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在做在呕吐\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is doing something. He's puking.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.14,0:27:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还需要一个袋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might need a bigger bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.74,0:27:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,也需要一个飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, we might need a bigger spaceship.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.88,0:27:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里难闻死了不能开开窗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It smells like fish socks in here. Can we at least open a window?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.88,0:27:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面不好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh. It's not much fun in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.52,0:27:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂你也打开了我的窗户\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! You opened up mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.99,0:27:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,新鲜空气有帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fresh air. That helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.99,0:27:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢我喜欢把头伸出窗外我最喜欢的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love this. I love sticking my head out the window. It's my favorite thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.25,0:28:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.68,0:28:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞西尔你还有几个呕吐袋？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cecil! How may puke bags do you have left?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.82,0:28:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make 'em count!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.94,0:28:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的西塞尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good job, Cecil!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.31,0:28:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不要低估呕吐的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never underestimate the power of puke.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.28,0:28:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿格诺特工报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Argonaut reporting.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.91,0:28:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 孩子们都没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, the kids are fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.02,0:28:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是房子就不一定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't say the same about the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.92,0:28:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们干了什么坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? What did they do?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.52,0:28:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他们干的是滴答人的手下毁了房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't do anything. They didn't destroy the house. Tick Tock's men did.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.46,0:28:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么阿格诺不是让你看着他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?! Argonaut, I told you to watch them!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.86,0:28:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看着他们的看着他们呕吐惊叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am watching them. I'm watching them puke and scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.33,0:28:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要给我额外补贴 - 把他们带到航天局\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We've gotta discuss hazard pay. - Just get them to the OSS.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.43,0:28:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要加薪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a raise!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.93,0:29:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望有个人能去接他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one person I want waiting there to greet them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.13,0:29:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,航天局总部你要联系谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}OSS Headquarters. How can I direct your call?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.44,0:29:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救了你的命赢了你一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved your life. one point for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.14,0:29:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你便吧呕吐袋炸弹是我的点子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever. The puke bags were my idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.84,0:29:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么老是争吵你们是姐弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you argue about everything? You're brother and sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.75,0:29:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像猫和狗整天打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're fighting like cats and dogs,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.75,0:29:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗和猫打架我能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}which I could understand why cats and dogs fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.15,0:29:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为猫很讨厌你们要淡定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cats are awful. Just chillax.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.19,0:29:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我自创的一个时髦的词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Part "chill, " part "relax." I fused 'em to make a trendy word.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.67,0:29:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到航天局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the OSS.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.30,0:29:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.71,0:29:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡门航天局特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carmen Cortez, secret agent of the OSS.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.04,0:29:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们继母是我姑姑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your stepmom is my aunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.28,0:29:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告：世上有个大坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, a word of caution to you would-be supervillains out there…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.62,0:29:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好的应对武器就是…果酱面包\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your best defense may be… a jelly donut.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.59,0:29:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我胡说什么啊难道还能\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I saying? What are they gonna do with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.46,0:30:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,用果酱面包砸敌人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are they gonna throw them at 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.66,0:30:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧我太帅了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just say it. I'm too attractive.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.10,0:30:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's face it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.33,0:30:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没抓过间谍也永远不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never caught a spy, and I probably never will.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.30,0:30:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议我们追捕时间守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we go after the Time Keeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.31,0:30:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's realistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.87,0:30:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,间谍节目做得怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you at with that piece for Spy Week?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.24,0:30:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,要到周五呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not due till Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.58,0:30:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天就是周五\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.08,0:30:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间加速了威尔森没看新闻吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time's speeding up, Wilson. Don't you keep up with the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.22,0:30:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我随便拍点素材\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me something on someone, anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.42,0:30:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天就交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And get it to me yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.65,0:30:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则你明天就不用来电视台上班了知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}or there won't be a tomorrow for you at the station. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.46,0:30:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了应该严肃的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to get serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.73,0:30:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽萨不接电话也许她设置了无线电沉默\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marissa's not picking up. Maybe she's under radio silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.04,0:30:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有很多事要让她解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got a lot of explaining to do, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.37,0:30:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没说过是个间谍？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She never told you she was a spy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.47,0:30:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过她已经退役了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, in her defense, she was retired.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.88,0:30:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 嗨 阿格诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, hello. - Hey, Argonaut!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.01,0:30:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你长这么高了这是钛合金吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a big girl now. Is that titanium alloy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.52,0:30:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想吃吗 - 请给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Treat? - Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.02,0:31:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.32,0:31:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.03,0:31:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,想看看我开始做间谍的地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna see how I got started as a spy?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.37,0:31:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.44,0:31:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是以前的小特务部门\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the old Spy Kids division.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.61,0:31:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woa.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.38,0:31:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为经费削减7年前关闭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They shut it down seven years ago due to budget cuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.25,0:31:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾当时是领先时代的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really sad. It was ahead of its time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.19,0:31:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,小特务部门是航天局的精英少年部门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spy Kids were an elite juvenile division of the OSS.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.06,0:31:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让你爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to explode you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.47,0:31:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,用于去成年间谍去不了的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Established to go where adult spies couldn't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.70,0:31:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,做普通间谍做不了的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and do what ordinary spies couldn't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.50,0:31:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉菲是我啊我们一起上的学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ralphie, it's me! We went to the academy together.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.44,0:31:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗…\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you do…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.57,0:31:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了它被关闭了也好它挺烦人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Now I see what, they've turned him off. Just as well. He's annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.95,0:32:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望将来能重启小特工部门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to bring back the Spy Kids division one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.38,0:32:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们称之为大皮靴和锤子手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We call those Stompers and Hammer Hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.45,0:32:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用电子场产生超人的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}They use electron fields to create superhuman impact force.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.16,0:32:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.89,0:32:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能捏碎东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can crush things.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.16,0:32:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,野外伏击必用品\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Field ambush supplies"?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.60,0:32:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,用于帮助间谍在现场设置陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Built to help a spy create on-the-spot booby traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.77,0:32:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,埋伏，混乱还有恶作剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}ambushes, mass confusion, and pranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.50,0:32:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 恶作剧？- 这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pranks? - I'll tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.41,0:32:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我允许你们每人挑选一样东西作为纪念品\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll let you guys pick out one gadget each as a souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.28,0:32:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的 - 我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mine. - Mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.04,0:32:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太激动了我只是让你们选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get too excited. I said that I'd let you guys pick out a gadget,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.91,0:32:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没说过会启动它\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I didn't say I'd activate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.62,0:32:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,在当年最出色的小间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in the day, the kids who made the best spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.35,0:32:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会等着设计出最棒的器械\N{\fnArial\fs30}were the ones who didn't wait around for the perfect gadgets.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.15,0:32:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是用已有的东西来完成任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}They made stuff happen with what they had on hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.82,0:32:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.67,0:32:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我弟弟朱尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and my brother, Juni.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.84,0:33:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是小间谍计划的第一个和最后一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were the first and last of the Spy Kids program.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.71,0:33:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.28,0:33:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不该谈起他我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall not speak of him. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.01,0:33:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们参观的终点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is where our grand tour ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.38,0:33:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿等着玛丽萨很快就来接你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait here. Marissa will pick you guys up in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.69,0:33:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能成为小间谍计划的候选人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we be candidates for the new Spy Kids program?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.36,0:33:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间证明一切对不起我该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time will tell. Sorry, guys, gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.22,0:33:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,航天局给了我们很多任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}OSS has us working around the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.09,0:33:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须阻止时间守护者趁时间守护者还没有阻止时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to stop the Time Keeper before the Time Keeper stops time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.73,0:33:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间守护者不像是坏人的名字吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Time Keeper. That's not much of a villain's name, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.37,0:33:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间守护者他有手表吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the Time Keeper. Has he got a watch, has he?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.84,0:33:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这名字一点不吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a scary name at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.21,0:33:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.30,0:34:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已到达本次任务目的地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have reached your destination for this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.67,0:34:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.27,0:34:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,滴答人攻击了我们的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Tick Tock attacked our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.24,0:34:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,追逐你的哥哥姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}and chased after your brother and sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.15,0:34:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看我们应该做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think we should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.65,0:34:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,消灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annihilate.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.92,0:34:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,消灭？好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annihilate? Good thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.72,0:34:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回到快乐时光特工穿上套装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back to the big-time, agent. Suit up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.02,0:34:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,情报显示滴答人在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intel places Tick Tock at this location.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.06,0:34:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他让他引着我们找到时间守护者的末日装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spot him and let him lead us to the Time Keeper's Armageddon device.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.13,0:34:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后汇报等待后援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then call in and wait for backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.60,0:34:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的后援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's my backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.67,0:34:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我需要你六点到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you. I need you at six o'clock, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.38,0:34:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Bring it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.68,0:34:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,末日装置随时都会到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Armageddon device will be here any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.55,0:34:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须为它的到来做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we must be ready for its arrival!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.45,0:34:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,掩护出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, cover the exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.79,0:34:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go. Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.99,0:34:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,集中精力集中精力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Focus up, focus. Focus!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.32,0:35:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么还有很短的时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? We're moments away.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.96,0:35:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的计划就要完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My plan is almost complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.80,0:35:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需要从烦人的孩子那里得到时间宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need to get the Chronos back from those meddlesome kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.48,0:35:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.41,0:35:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么刚才是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Are you kidding me? Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.55,0:35:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的传送器掉了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you drop your transmission?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.55,0:35:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊你们别放屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Gentlemen, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.19,0:35:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个屁难闻死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That smells like lentils and desperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.29,0:35:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,天真是的跟着人跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, that's mental. It's following you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.86,0:35:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到位置上专心听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back on your marks. Focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.66,0:35:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,熏得我都看不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm blinded. Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.97,0:35:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,它来了终于来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's here, it's here. It's finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.80,0:35:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,各就各位这是我们都在等待的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Places, everyone. This is the moment we've all been waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.55,0:35:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,来的正准时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.75,0:35:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,滴滴答滴滴答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hickory-dickory dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.68,0:36:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,间谍跑到钟表上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spy ran up the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.59,0:36:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,时钟敲打了一下间谍就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The clock struck one, and the spy was done.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.39,0:36:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,滴答人胜利了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Game, set, and match, Tick Tock.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.76,0:36:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.10,0:36:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的助手？一个挖鼻孔的宝宝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your sidekick? A nose-picking baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.27,0:36:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, get in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.70,0:36:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝宝看来我们中了圈套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, looks like we've been set up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.77,0:36:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,消灭她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finish her. Boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.77,0:36:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.89,0:36:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你下次好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better luck next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.96,0:36:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,罪行越大就会越开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bigger the crime, the better the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.43,0:36:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真让我恼火\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is really starting to tick me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.01,0:36:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,10个绿瓶子挂在墙上\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Ten green bottles hanging on a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.04,0:37:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,10个绿瓶子挂在墙上\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Ten green bottles hanging on a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.11,0:37:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果一个不小心掉下来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And if one green bottle should accidentally fall."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.72,0:37:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在生继母的气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still mad at Stepmother…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.89,0:37:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marissa.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.49,0:37:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟然不告诉我们她是间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for not telling us she was a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.02,0:37:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没告诉爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}For not telling Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.59,0:37:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许她辞职是为了能有时间陪我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she quit to make more time for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.76,0:37:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.06,0:37:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是也想当间谍吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, wouldn't you wanna be a spy?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.83,0:37:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.40,0:37:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,比玛丽莎更强的间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even better spy than Marissa.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.77,0:37:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.91,0:37:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡门说了优秀的小间谍不会干等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carmen said that the best Spy Kids were the ones who didn't wait around.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.41,0:37:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们主动把事情做成\N{\fnArial\fs30}They went out and made stuff happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.28,0:37:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须是很出色的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would have to be something really amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.92,0:37:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 比如抓住时间守护者？- 糟糕的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like catching the Time Keeper? - Bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.29,0:37:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们比谁先抓住时间守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}First person to get the bad guy wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.96,0:37:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再比赛了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not another competi…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.96,0:37:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是让你们淡定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What part of "chillax" don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.73,0:37:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,比就比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Game on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.77,0:37:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.34,0:37:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个电击口香糖也不管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}This Electric Shock Gumball doesn't work, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.44,0:38:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你嚼口香糖的时候我却在研究我的锤子手\N{\fnArial\fs30}While you're chewing gum over there, I'm hacking into my Hammer Hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.48,0:38:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.72,0:38:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.86,0:38:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.26,0:38:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.57,0:38:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面写着内含电池\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says batteries are included.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.77,0:38:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,念念小字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read the fine print.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.17,0:38:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面不含有\N{\fnArial\fs30}"on and off button…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.37,0:38:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}…not included."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.14,0:38:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.41,0:38:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.48,0:38:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.82,0:38:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们干什么你们没有资格到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you kids doing? You don't have security clearance to be out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.22,0:38:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的狗走丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um… We lost our dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.89,0:38:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们刚刚找到了它看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but we just found him. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.60,0:39:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好 不对 汪汪 不对 嗷嗷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. I mean, bark. I mean, woof, woof.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.00,0:39:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不应该是… - 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Definitely, I meant… - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.90,0:39:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也不信看来我们要一起行动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they're not falling for it. Looks we're all in this together now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.34,0:39:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.54,0:39:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 喂 不要跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! - Hey! Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.61,0:39:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过让一下你的鞋很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, excuse me. Coming through. Nice shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.68,0:39:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 对不起 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh! - Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.52,0:39:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,拦住两个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop those kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.32,0:39:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跑不过他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll never outrun them!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.79,0:39:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,会的拉我的项圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we will! Pull my collar!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.39,0:39:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,来一层油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oil slick.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.97,0:39:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好棒啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.24,0:39:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.97,0:39:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还在追我们 - 拉我的尾巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're still after us! - Pull my tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.14,0:39:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,尾部投弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Butt bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.72,0:39:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是史上最酷的狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the coolest dog ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.06,0:39:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错这是奖励我接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely. That's an award and I accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.99,0:40:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.96,0:40:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等还有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, one more. one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.40,0:40:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉我的手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull my finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.41,0:40:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.58,0:40:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.85,0:40:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有什么用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.32,0:40:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,只为了让我笑笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just makes me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.49,0:40:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,无声的致命武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silent but lethal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.53,0:40:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么找到时间守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we gonna find the Time Keeper?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.73,0:40:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道肯定要比逃出休息室困难得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, if it was that hard just getting out of the lounge.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.87,0:40:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是远程传送电波发射器\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the Telematic organism oscillation Transporter…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.17,0:40:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,简称T00T\N{\fnArial\fs30}…otherwise known as TOOT.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.77,0:40:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡门说过不要依赖于器械要开动大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carmen said not to rely on our gadgets, but to use our heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.38,0:40:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿格诺你对时间守护者了解多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Argonaut, what do you know about the Time Keeper?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.58,0:40:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,先输入我的密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, type in my passcode.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.55,0:40:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,00汪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double-O-Woof.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.39,0:41:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经拦截了加密信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've intercepted several coded messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.25,0:41:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,含有时间守护者的地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}as to the Time Keeper's location.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.89,0:41:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没人能破解电码\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no one's been able to crack the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.99,0:41:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是密码是打乱了顺序\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a code. It's an anagram.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.33,0:41:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,去掉所有数字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop all the numbers,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.90,0:41:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,用剩下的字母组合成词\N{\fnArial\fs30}switch all the letters around, and it spells something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.37,0:41:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,一流手表修理店？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Big Time Watch Repair Shop"?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.20,0:41:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏人在一家手表店威胁世界？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bad guy is holding the world hostage from a watch shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.64,0:41:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自称是时间守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he is called the Time Keeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.68,0:41:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏人确实希望他们的密室有个主题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Villains do love their secret hideouts to have a theme.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.01,0:41:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这能让我们不离开大楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will take us to the Time Keeper's shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.15,0:41:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能把我们带到时间守护者的店\N{\fnArial\fs30}without having to leave the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.09,0:41:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好别让我们四分五裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better not disintegrate us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.89,0:41:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我觉得必须分裂才行 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think that's sort of the point. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.43,0:41:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们拿走了时间宝石别让他们跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took the Chronos Sapphire. Don't let them get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.57,0:41:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这家伙把我们汽化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weirdo! You vaporized us!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.18,0:41:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的脸没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lost face.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.45,0:42:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里臭哄哄的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something stinks around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.52,0:42:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你是个“屁股头”\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always knew you were a butthead.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.29,0:42:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真想给你一拳只可惜找不到拳头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd give you a knuckle sandwich if I knew where my knuckles were!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.10,0:42:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的胃里翻腾的厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I think my stomach is inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.84,0:42:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像少了一个肾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm missing a kidney.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.28,0:42:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿格诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Argonaut!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.91,0:42:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗了你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.88,0:42:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,逗你玩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just pulling your leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.28,0:42:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 厉害 - 真搞笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Brilliant. - A comedian.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.69,0:42:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玛丽萨在电话上 - 玛丽萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Marissa's on the line. - Marissa?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.09,0:42:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.99,0:42:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 把通讯器给妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Give Mommy the comlink.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.63,0:42:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.16,0:42:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起除了技术故障卡门孩子们怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, technical difficulties, Carmen. How are the kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.53,0:42:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.93,0:42:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,在小睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}…napping?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.10,0:42:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好他们到底在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. Where are they really?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.57,0:43:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起他们把自己传送出了航天局\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really sorry. They TOOTed themselves out of the OSS.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.61,0:43:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,把坐标发给我我们到那里见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send me their coordinates. I'll meet you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.78,0:43:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很像你卡门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, she's a lot like you, Carmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.78,0:43:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这正是我担心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.79,0:43:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定是这个地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure this is the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.83,0:43:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想想他叫时间守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's think. He's called the Time Keeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.40,0:43:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个房间都是钟表\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a room full of clocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.20,0:43:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,走我们去看看对面的奶酪店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, let's go, let's check out that cheese shop across the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.94,0:43:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是一个打乱顺序的词\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's another anagram.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.71,0:43:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还可以拼写成什么单词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switch all those letters around and what do they spell?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.57,0:43:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱茶的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, um, tea lover.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.84,0:43:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 厉害 - 电梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Brilliant. - Elevator.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.15,0:43:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这肯定是入口\N{\fnArial\fs30}This must be the access panel.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.98,0:43:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 - 我赢了一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oops. - One point for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.59,0:43:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this little guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.22,0:43:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢了两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two points for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.86,0:43:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可以帮忙 - 冒着失败的风险？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You could help, genius. - And risk losing?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.79,0:43:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,密码正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Password accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.16,0:44:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先别说赢了先看看通往哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see where this leads before we call you the winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.13,0:44:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们应该比赛谁更烦人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have a competition to see which one of you is the most annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.38,0:44:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没用替身没用替身\N{\fnArial\fs30}All my own stunts, all my own stunts.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.72,0:44:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个巨大的钟表\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's… a giant clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.09,0:44:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不这是个巨大的死亡陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's a giant death trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.80,0:44:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是时针\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the hour hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.73,0:44:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是分针\N{\fnArial\fs30}The minute hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.20,0:44:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是秒针\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's the second hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.94,0:44:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.67,0:44:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.51,0:44:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这应该是切人的指针\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's probably the cut-you-in-half hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.69,0:45:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要回家 - 那里有个门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, I'm going home. - There's a door over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.10,0:45:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.96,0:45:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个完整无缺跑过去的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}First person to get across without getting smushed…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.83,0:45:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,获胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}…wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.87,0:45:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说看见别人跳悬崖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, listen, just because one person jumps off a cliff,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.21,0:45:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要跟着跳下去是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}it doesn't mean you have to follow them. Does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.64,0:45:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it does, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.45,0:45:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brilliant. Here we go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.65,0:45:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,切人的指针来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here comes the cut-you-in-half hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.32,0:45:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跳 - 我还是趴下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jump! - I'll duck, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.15,0:45:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.43,0:45:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有更好的办法过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be a better way to pass the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.16,0:45:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来了速度更快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here it comes again! It's moving faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.26,0:45:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为时间加速了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's because time is speeding up!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.97,0:45:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着我的任务是看着你们不是看着你们去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I was told to watch you kids, but not watch you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.24,0:45:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞西尔坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cecil! Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.51,0:45:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个看着好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now this is fun to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.39,0:46:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么样 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You OK? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.12,0:46:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢了一分\N{\fnArial\fs30}I win. one point for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.83,0:46:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 - 快来这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ow. - Come on. This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.80,0:46:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 起作用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey… Hey, it's working!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.40,0:46:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.17,0:46:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搜寻间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spy a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.68,0:46:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿摄像机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.25,0:46:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,表演时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's show time.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.15,0:46:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的五年计划要实现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My five-year plan is coming together.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.19,0:46:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的重大突破\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my big break.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.36,0:46:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这次成功的基础上将来再实现黄金时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we just build on this success and maybe someday hit primetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.99,0:46:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄金时间就是自由时间陪着和孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Primetime means free time… to spend with my kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.20,0:46:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好计划只不过五年以后就没有孩子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great plan. only in five years, they won't be kids anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.23,0:46:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.50,0:46:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就抽出时间陪孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spend the time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.37,0:46:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有件事你将来总会有时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause the one thing you'll always find time for later…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.94,0:46:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是后悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.45,0:47:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.19,0:47:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们差点被切成两半就为了这台电脑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We almost got cut in half for a computer?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.52,0:47:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面有很多…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot here about…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.03,0:47:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,“困在时间中的男孩”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Boy Trapped In Time."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.93,0:47:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不阻止时间守护者我们也将会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's gonna happen to us if we don't stop the Time Keeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.57,0:47:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据电脑所说他曾经是时光旅行专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to this, he was part of a time travel experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.24,0:47:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,上世纪三十年代就有时光旅行？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time travel in the 1930s?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.77,0:47:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时的人有很多奇思异想\N{\fnArial\fs30}People sure did talk funny back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.41,0:47:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,1936年决战计划录像\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Project Armageddon Test Footage, 1936.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.68,0:47:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间宝石被发现是唯一能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chronos Sapphire, discovered to be the only known element.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.15,0:47:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止决战装置的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}able to stop the Armageddon device."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.42,0:47:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们必须离开这里 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to get out of here! - What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.33,0:47:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在找这串项链\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're after the necklace!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.31,0:48:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会停止你的表\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll stop your clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.65,0:48:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心碰头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.55,0:48:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}oops! Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.16,0:48:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但好消息是你的身高可以坐这趟车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the good news is, you're tall enough to go on all the rides.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.80,0:48:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩间谍游戏？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Playing spy games?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.80,0:48:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们孩子以为自己有无穷的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You children think you have all the time in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.94,0:48:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但很快我就会有\N{\fnArial\fs30}but soon I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.61,0:48:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把项链交过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand over the necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.58,0:48:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你们应该找个更秘密的巢穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's time you found a more secret lair.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.45,0:48:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玛丽萨 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Marissa! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.92,0:48:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave my kids alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.32,0:48:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,继子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stepkids.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.79,0:48:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘她是来救我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh! She's here to save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.49,0:48:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么能把时间浪费在这种争吵上\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you waste time bickering about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.06,0:48:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们对于做家人没有兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you have no interest in being a family,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.13,0:49:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就不配得到任何时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you don't deserve any time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.40,0:49:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有一点说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's right about one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.90,0:49:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要想离开这里的话就要像家人一样合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're gonna get outta here, we need to work as a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.97,0:49:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动你们的器械\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire up your gadgets.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.17,0:49:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有被启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.61,0:49:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只是纪念品 - 现在不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're just souvenirs. - Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.09,0:49:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,锤子时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hammer time.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.31,0:49:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.62,0:49:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一家钟表店？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A watch shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.99,0:50:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍微向左继续绕着房子走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slight left and proceed around building.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.57,0:50:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在右拐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.00,0:50:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spy detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.77,0:50:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是垃圾箱 - 发现间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a dumpster. - Spy detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.07,0:50:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,向前走左拐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walk forward now. Turn left now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.44,0:50:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,左脚右脚左脚右脚一大步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left foot, right foot, left foot, big right foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.81,0:50:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,到中心停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Center and stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.81,0:50:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,向下继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proceed below.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.48,0:50:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这烦人的声音说这里有个间谍看\N{\fnArial\fs30}The annoying voice is saying there's a spy right here. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.52,0:50:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在向下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proceed below now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.39,0:50:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不只是垃圾箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is more than a dumpster!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.90,0:50:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 没关系 再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry! - It's OK! Do it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.56,0:51:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,天这么多香菇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shiitake mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.44,0:51:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here. Come here, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.08,0:51:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.28,0:51:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是间谍猎手威尔伯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wilbur Wilson, Spy Hunter here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.78,0:51:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看到我正在一处地下巢穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can see, I'm in some sort of underground secret lair.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.41,0:51:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们国家的顶级间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}where the battle for freedom and justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.22,0:51:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在为自由和正义而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}is being fought by our country's top spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.49,0:51:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,在上面看不见很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really can't see much from up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.32,0:51:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是经过放大就能看得清了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we can zoom in with our Spy Hunt Cam and get a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.09,0:51:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孩子们看到以后会很激动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the kids are gonna flip when they see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.99,0:51:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍到了吗我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get that? You got it? Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.46,0:51:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿格诺别愣着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Argonaut, do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.33,0:51:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能干什么我是宠物不是战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want me to do? I'm a lover, not a fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.84,0:51:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.07,0:51:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击模式启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attack mode activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.14,0:51:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,表演时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's show time!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.88,0:52:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油阿格诺加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, Argo, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.22,0:52:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁把这段视频发到网上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, someone put that on YouTube!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.09,0:52:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间苍蝇陪你们玩玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time flies when you're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.37,0:52:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的项链\N{\fnArial\fs30}My necklace!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.97,0:52:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们带孩子离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get the kids out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.01,0:52:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿格诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Argonaut!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.95,0:52:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.55,0:52:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托我正打算把他埋在后院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on! I was gonna bury him in the backyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.35,0:52:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们走这都是计划的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them go. It's all part of the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.62,0:52:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有了时间宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have the Chronos Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.69,0:52:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在没什么能阻止我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing can stop us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.23,0:52:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起丢失了项链玛丽萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about the necklace, Marissa.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.54,0:53:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起丢失了项链玛丽萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sorry about the necklace, Marissa."
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.41,0:53:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初就该还给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've given it back to you when you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.11,0:53:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you should've.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.24,0:53:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道时间守护者在找它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had no idea the Time Keeper wanted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.68,0:53:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是傻孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We're just dumb kids."
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.25,0:53:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不可能知道这是保密信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't have known. It was classified.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.12,0:53:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界有大麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole world's in big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.72,0:53:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,别看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.92,0:53:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,都怪我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all our fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.19,0:53:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起没告诉你们我是间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm sorry I didn't share with you that I was a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.26,0:53:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但重要的是你们安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was important to me that you were both protected and safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.46,0:53:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,重要的是阻止时间守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's important is stopping the Time Keeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.06,0:53:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,再给我们一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.60,0:53:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你两个这么勇敢我很自豪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two have been so very brave and I'm so proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.40,0:53:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这像是我妈妈会说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds like something my mom would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.34,0:53:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 总部让我们回去汇报 - 带孩子回到航天局\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They want us back for a debrief. - Take the kids back to OSS.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.25,0:53:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我随后就到 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll meet you there. - Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.78,0:53:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你救了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for rescuing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.12,0:53:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.72,0:53:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前经常这么惹麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to get in trouble like this all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.92,0:53:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨老婆对不起没给你打通有好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, sweetheart. Sorry I missed you. Great news!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.29,0:53:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拍下了一个真正的间谍在钟表店里的打斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the most amazing footage of a real spy battle at the watch shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.20,0:54:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将在今晚黄金时间播出\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna put it on the air tonight, primetime!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.63,0:54:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你和孩子们会很自豪的 - 哦 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The kids are gonna be so proud. - Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.07,0:54:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱你想你需要你再见给我回电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love you, miss you, need you. Bye! Call me back!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.44,0:54:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你成功了间谍猎手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it, Spy Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.11,0:54:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.41,0:54:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将凭此获得艾米奖普利策奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna win an Emmy for this. A Pulitzer.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.98,0:54:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,后退后退她还带着个宝宝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, go back, go back. Does she have a baby with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.32,0:54:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的真是无价之宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she does! Oh, that's priceless!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.89,0:54:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要打上字幕：间谍是不称职的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, we're gonna need a graphic that reads "Spies Are Unfit Moms."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.46,0:54:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔伯你再问问儿童保护机构的看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Wilbur, see if you can get a quote from Child Protective Services.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.59,0:54:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,运气好的话他们会把宝宝带走送到寄养家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're lucky, they'll take the kids away, put 'em in foster care! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.17,0:54:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 威尔伯 - 对不起我笨手笨脚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wilbur! - Sorry. I'm a klutz.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.70,0:54:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系这里还有原来的胶片\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. I've got the original tape right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.67,0:54:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘了吃午饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hm! Didn't get any lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.61,0:54:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,味道就像鸡肉你们吃吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tastes like chicken! Want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.38,0:54:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}out!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.05,0:54:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.19,0:54:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spy detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.86,0:55:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, really? Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.99,0:55:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.16,0:55:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别叫我亲爱的已经没什么亲爱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't "honey" me. There's no "honey"ing anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.03,0:55:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a spy!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.70,0:55:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你发现了 - 我是间谍猎手嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You found out. - Well, I'm a Spy Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.24,0:55:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我水平不行因为和一个间谍生活在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And apparently I'm not a very good one, since I've been living with one.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.84,0:55:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我临产那天就辞职了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I retired the day we had the baby…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.91,0:55:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为家人对我来说是最重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…because our family is the most important thing in the world to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.52,0:55:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.15,0:55:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,真对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.19,0:55:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉自己像傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. I feel like such a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.96,0:55:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何嫁给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.73,0:55:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是跟人打赌输了吧 - 你是我爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You must've lost a bet, right? - You're the man I love.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.66,0:55:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在我是失业的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, now I'm the man without a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.00,0:55:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许也要失去家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}and maybe without a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.40,0:55:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are the kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.14,0:55:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正在航天局的保护之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're under protective surveillance at the OSS.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.31,0:55:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能在那里更安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're probably safer there anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.58,0:55:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的亲生父亲没本事保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, their own dad can't protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.61,0:55:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们我爱他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell them I love them.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.05,0:56:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about us?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.25,0:56:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.39,0:56:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要一点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}…need time.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.90,0:56:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的时间都不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.54,0:56:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人预测世界末日将是一团大火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some predicted it would come in a blaze of fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.38,0:56:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次大洪水但只有古代玛雅人说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}a giant flood, but it was the ancient Mayans who got it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.25,0:56:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们预测是人类日历的终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}when they predicted an end to the human calendar,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.42,0:56:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间的终点\N{\fnArial\fs30}the end of time itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.62,0:56:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能拯救我们避免迫在眉睫的毁灭？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can anyone save us from this impending apocalypse,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.06,0:56:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次最终的末日这次…\N{\fnArial\fs30}this final doomsday, this…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.46,0:56:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Armageddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.96,0:56:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,也称为威尔斯实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also known as the Wells Experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.77,0:56:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,在当时这个奇妙的装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in the day, this contraption.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.10,0:56:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点导致我们世界的终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}almost caused the end of the world as we know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.24,0:56:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以航天局终止了这次试验\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why the OSS shut the experiment down.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.94,0:56:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这装置至于1 3级安全防范中直到今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}and placed the device in Level 13 lockdown, where it remains today.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.54,0:57:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界的命运系于一发\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fate of the world is on the line here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.51,0:57:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我召来了我们最出色的特工之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I'm calling upon one of our most valued and skilled operatives,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.52,0:57:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,考特特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Cortez.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.99,0:57:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他本已退役却毅然来帮助我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has even come out of retirement to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.63,0:57:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.71,0:57:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.65,0:57:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很高兴回来 - 当初就不该走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's good to be back. - Then you never should have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.29,0:57:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这7年去了哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have you been the last seven years?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.03,0:57:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你了还算是秘密任务吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I told you, then it wouldn't be called a secret mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.86,0:57:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不稀罕知道我只庆幸能摆脱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like I missed you or anything. I needed a break from your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.50,0:57:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是巧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what an incredible coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.30,0:57:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也庆幸能摆脱你 - 随你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I needed a break from yours. - Oh, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.00,0:58:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.58,0:58:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,家人重逢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family reunion.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.18,0:58:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们的事不重要 - 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This isn't about us. - Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.11,0:58:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡门重要的是拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carmen, this is about saving the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.32,0:58:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不配这个徽章 - 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't deserve to wear this badge. - Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.59,0:58:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.32,0:58:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了特工们让我们确保还有明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, agents. Let's make sure there is a tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.53,0:58:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去拯救世界吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go save the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.73,0:58:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做什么我们的任务呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we get to do? What's our assignment?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.97,0:58:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.70,0:58:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是的为什么让我们休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man! Why are we in time-out?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.67,0:58:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们找到了时间守护者为什么不让我们去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found the Time Keeper. So, why are we grounded?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.48,0:58:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么让我们看孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why do we have to watch the baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.25,0:58:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,严格来说是我看着她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technically, I'm watching her.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.98,0:58:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时我是一条狗有时是儿童娱乐中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes you're the dog, sometimes you're the baby entertainment center.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.12,0:58:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是邓杰航天局主任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danger D'Amo, director of the OSS.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.22,0:58:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想赞扬你们勇敢的贡献\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to commend you on your brave service.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.02,0:58:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的才能很随你们妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bobbleheads really take after your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.16,0:58:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,后妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stepmom.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.53,0:58:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你个建议孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me give you some advice, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.20,0:59:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要受这种想法的影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get balled up over that kind of baloney.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.60,0:59:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她花时间爱你你也要爱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She takes the time to love you… you love her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.91,0:59:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 漂亮的手表 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice watch. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.45,0:59:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我老爸送我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a gift from my pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.05,0:59:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说话很有趣 - 你长得很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sure talk funny. - You sure look funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.39,0:59:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 邓杰·迪亚摩 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Danger D'Amo. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.75,0:59:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道你的名字是打乱顺序的词吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know your name is an anagram?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.33,0:59:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的名字中的字母打乱一下顺序就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switch the letters of your name around, and it spells…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.63,0:59:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Armageddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.23,0:59:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,末日装置的末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in the Armageddon device.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.13,0:59:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这要么是巧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either that's a coincidence…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.94,0:59:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么只是偶然的巧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or that's just an incredible coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.68,0:59:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在滴答响\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're ticking.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.08,0:59:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是老表\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an old watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.45,0:59:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你戴着三只表\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're wearing three more.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.83,1:00:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是时间守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the Time Keeper.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.60,1:00:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想和你们聊聊但是时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'd love to stick around and chat but time is running out.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.64,1:00:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好人中的老大就是坏人中的老大？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The head of the good guys is actually the head of the bad guys?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.68,1:00:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒没料到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not see that coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.25,1:00:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被困在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trapped in here!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.62,1:00:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,找个通讯器或者电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around for a comlink or a phone!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.55,1:00:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须通知玛丽萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to warn Marissa!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.67,1:00:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是威尔森特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Wilson.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.13,1:00:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 转身 - 这是陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Turn around! - It's a trap!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.50,1:00:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 时间守护者就是邓杰 - 这是他的真实身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Time Keeper is Danger! - That's his secret identity!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.17,1:00:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没时间陪你们玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't have time for your pranks right now. OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.48,1:00:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟阿格诺学着看孩子谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch Argonaut watch the baby. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.99,1:01:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,末日装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Armageddon device.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.56,1:01:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么小\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's tiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.27,1:01:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果时间是个测试家人是最合适的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If time's the test, family is best.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.61,1:01:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.21,1:01:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好特工你们来得很准时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, agents. You're right on time.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.79,1:01:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kids were right.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.16,1:01:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'm not…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.43,1:01:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们以为的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who you thought I was.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.36,1:01:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么真正的末日装置在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where's the real Armageddon device?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.36,1:01:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,在航天局一直在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back at the OSS, where it's always been.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.47,1:01:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.50,1:01:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I must get back to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.20,1:01:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.14,1:01:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只好表\N{\fnArial\fs30}A really nice watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.61,1:01:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是航天局所有特工的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's also a freeze transmitter.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.58,1:02:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷冻发射器\N{\fnArial\fs30}for all agents at the OSS.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.08,1:02:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,该去掉我的对手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to take out the competition.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.99,1:02:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓杰不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danger, don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.07,1:02:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在停止世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now… to stop the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.35,1:02:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么没冷冻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't I freeze?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.92,1:02:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被困在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm… trapped in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.29,1:02:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要增援\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.33,1:02:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是没有后援都被定住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there are no reinforcements. They're all frozen.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.00,1:02:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.13,1:02:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上大多地方的时间都耗尽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time has run out for most of the planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.67,1:03:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,十八个时区的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eighteen time zones have been frozen.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.74,1:03:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经被时间守护者的末日装置停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the Time Keeper's Armageddon device.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.38,1:03:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以确定的是正朝我们而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thing's for certain… it's heading our way.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.21,1:03:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们不能放弃希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we must not lose hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.95,1:03:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,坑爹呢？没希望了我们死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are we kidding? It's over! We're toast!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.22,1:03:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,请注意特工小子你们已经被征召\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention, Spy Kids. You have been activated.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.32,1:03:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复你们已经被征召\N{\fnArial\fs30}I repeat, you have been activated.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.99,1:03:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和我们说话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he talking to us?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.43,1:03:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在时间守护者正要占据航天局总部\N{\fnArial\fs30}At this very moment, the Time Keeper is taking over OSS Headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.87,1:03:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们拯救世界的时刻到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your time has come to save the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.64,1:03:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部航天局特工都被定住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every OSS agent has been frozen.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.07,1:03:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,要靠你们去关闭末日装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's up to you to shut down the Armageddon device.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.51,1:03:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,抢回项链这是唯一能阻止它的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the necklace back. It's the only thing that can stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.01,1:03:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么能抢回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how are we supposed to do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.15,1:03:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,特工小子总是能打败坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spy Kids have always been able to beat the bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.32,1:03:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为大人太多虑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because adults over-think things.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.22,1:03:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对孩子来说一切都是可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to a kid, everything is possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.82,1:03:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.36,1:03:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要用你们的想象力合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just use your imagination and work with each other,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.29,1:03:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是对抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}not against each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.53,1:03:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么不再比赛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So no more competing against each other?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.03,1:04:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.73,1:04:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿格诺 - 攻击模式帮帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Argonaut! - Attack mode, por favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.24,1:04:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 撞开门 - 小菜一碟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Attack the door. - Argo smash!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.31,1:04:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝宝怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the baby?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.25,1:04:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,特工小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spy Kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.58,1:04:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,特工狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spy Dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.22,1:04:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,特工宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spy Baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.19,1:04:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你们现在成了特工小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that you've been activated as Spy Kids,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.76,1:04:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是精英部队的一员了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are part of an elite team,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.53,1:04:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要合作就像朱尼所说\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we need to work together, like Juni said.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.30,1:04:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能再竞争\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more competitions.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.77,1:04:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要闯进航天局密室\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to break into the OSS vault,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.54,1:04:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到时间守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}get to the Time Keeper,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.37,1:04:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到时间宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}find the Chronos Sapphire,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.47,1:04:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后用它来阻止末日装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}then use it to stop the Armageddon device,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.81,1:04:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然也拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, of course, save the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.11,1:04:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞西尔你负责密室丽贝卡你负责恶作剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cecil, you take the vault. Rebecca, you're on pranks.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.48,1:04:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于我当然是最艰巨的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}And l, of course, will take the toughest assignment of all…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.75,1:04:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,看孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll watch the baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.66,1:05:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来他定住特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I realized the only way he could freeze agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.19,1:05:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是通过航天局的徽章\N{\fnArial\fs30}was through their OSS badges.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.16,1:05:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.46,1:05:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你扔掉我的徽章 卡门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for trashing mine, Carmen.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.77,1:05:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢朱尼 解开你姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Juni. Unfreeze your sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.30,1:05:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的但首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, but first…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.64,1:05:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要留个纪念\N{\fnArial\fs30}…this is how I remember you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.67,1:05:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.34,1:05:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 朱尼 - 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Juni! - Hm?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.44,1:05:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,解开她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfreeze her.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.44,1:05:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是这样多安静啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's so peaceful and quiet.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.85,1:05:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.92,1:05:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是我带领行动就不会发生这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This never would've happened if I was mission leader.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.12,1:05:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我征召了丽贝卡和塞西尔 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I activated Rebecca and Cecil. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.02,1:05:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你低估他们的能力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're more ready than you think.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.72,1:05:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们有个三长两短你就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anything happens to those kids, you're toast.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.93,1:05:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.17,1:05:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real smooth, diaper lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.14,1:05:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是根据直觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just following my instincts.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.98,1:05:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的直觉烂透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, your in-stinks!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.35,1:05:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们本是最棒的间谍组合\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two were the best spy team ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.32,1:05:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么变成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.72,1:06:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊你这么多年去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Where have you been all these years?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.65,1:06:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想靠自己闯荡也努力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to strike out on my own, and I struck out. OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.16,1:06:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,父母把家族的生意也留给你一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, but Mom and Dad left the family business to the both of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.19,1:06:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.86,1:06:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得继续和我姐姐一起工作很没出息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I thought it wasn't cool to keep working with my sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.37,1:06:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样才有出息\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what would've made you cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.47,1:06:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽萨呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Marissa?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.81,1:06:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是沼泽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's quicksand!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.25,1:06:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逼我把你打晕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me punch your lights out.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.53,1:06:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there he is!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.70,1:06:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们见识我黑暗的一面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you've seen my dark side.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.94,1:07:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,电量不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}Low battery?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.15,1:07:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要依赖于器械\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Don't rely on your gadgets."
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.26,1:07:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.64,1:07:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.17,1:07:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anyone in here?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.21,1:07:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打开门了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get the door open yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.82,1:07:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要走别的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we need another way in.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.85,1:07:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好我一会就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. I'll be there in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.66,1:07:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.16,1:07:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抓住了一个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You caught a kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.01,1:08:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一路顺风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy the ride!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.79,1:08:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.49,1:08:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}We give up.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.69,1:08:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是拿回项链的唯一办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way we'll get the necklace back.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.96,1:08:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我的暗示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just follow my lead.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.03,1:08:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,交出武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand over your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.41,1:08:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.32,1:08:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,航天局特工都被时间定住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OSS agents have been frozen in time.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.33,1:08:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有人能拯救吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there someone, anyone, out there that can save the day?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.63,1:09:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好威尔伯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Wilbur.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.23,1:09:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的我是你的狗我在说话但是现在别管这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, this is your dog, and I'm talking, but never mind about that now.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.97,1:09:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽贝卡和塞西尔有了危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca and Cecil are in danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.20,1:09:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,被时间守护者抓住了需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been captured by the Time Keeper and they need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.04,1:09:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话你可能不信不过你是他们最后的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's hard to believe, sir, but you're their last hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.04,1:09:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我劝你快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd hurry if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.08,1:10:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在比划什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with the jazz hands? Huh, kiddies?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.65,1:10:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弟弟有听力障碍而你这个笨蛋手下拿走了他的助听器\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother's hearing impaired. And your goon took his hearing aids.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.29,1:10:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,把助听器还给他 我们不是恶人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him his hearing aids back. We're not monsters here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.73,1:10:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实不是你只是要终结世界而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You're only trying to end the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.80,1:10:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.26,1:10:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,末日装置不是为了结束世界或停止时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Armageddon device was not meant to end the world or stop time.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.50,1:10:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了让时间倒流\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was meant to travel back in time.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.71,1:10:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我回到这个时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}To get me back to that.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.14,1:10:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的父亲 - 儿子过来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My father. - Son, come here! Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.85,1:10:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔斯实验是进行时间旅行的早期尝试\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Wells Experiment was an early attempt to time travel.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.72,1:11:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是出事之前的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's me before the accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.69,1:11:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲正在研究机器原型\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father was working on the original prototype.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.32,1:11:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,正准备开始测试机器却出了意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were just about to test the machine when it went haywire.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.70,1:11:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让我不要靠近实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me not to play near the lab.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.20,1:11:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我从来不听\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I never listened.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.14,1:11:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被困在时间中很多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}It trapped me in time for so many years I almost lost count.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.51,1:11:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是被定在时间中的男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were the Boy Frozen In Time.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.28,1:11:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲用一生的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father spent his entire life…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.38,1:11:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,想拯救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…trying to set me free.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.46,1:11:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看着他变老\N{\fnArial\fs30}I watched him grow old…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.83,1:11:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及最后的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and, eventually…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.30,1:11:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,去世\N{\fnArial\fs30}…die.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.74,1:11:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,航天局终止了试验\N{\fnArial\fs30}The OSS shut down the experiment.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.84,1:11:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,用了一个天外来的物质\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a solution that literally fell from the sky…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.38,1:12:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}… the Chronos Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.15,1:12:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,等效果消失以后我成了孩子身体的成年人\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the effects wore off, I was a grown man in a boy's body.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.92,1:12:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友都去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All my friends were gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.26,1:12:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.59,1:12:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.89,1:12:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所爱的一切都不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything and everyone I cared about was no more.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.50,1:12:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你这么做只是为了再看你父亲一眼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all of this is so you can see your father again?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.77,1:12:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望有更多的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want more time!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.74,1:12:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}With him.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.44,1:12:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给了我一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave me everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.41,1:12:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我却忽视了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I couldn't even give him the time of day,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.51,1:12:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我当时不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I didn't know…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.28,1:12:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在一起的时间有这么短\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that our time would be so short together.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.65,1:12:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是等我回去就不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now when I go back, things are gonna be different.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.29,1:12:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不可能 - 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, they won't. - Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.86,1:12:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可能回到从前\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't actually travel through time.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.09,1:12:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间是不变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time stays the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.89,1:12:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只能是创造出\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just creating multiple versions of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.56,1:12:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,出现在不同时间的自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}that appear at different points in time.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.80,1:13:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他错了我们的计划会奏效的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's wrong. our plan will work.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.44,1:13:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前试过也失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've tried this before and failed.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.91,1:13:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我估计你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my guess is that you've…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.11,1:13:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经多次回到从前\N{\fnArial\fs30}…already gone back in time a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.88,1:13:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你第一次回到从前\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't the first time you've traveled back.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.98,1:13:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你每次回来就会变得更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And every time you return, you come back worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.73,1:13:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一次你的计划都失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each time, your plan fails.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.06,1:13:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用另一个自己再次尝试\N{\fnArial\fs30}You try it again with another you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.10,1:13:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你什么时候才能明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when are you going to learn…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.00,1:13:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法改变过去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you can't change the past?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.83,1:13:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只会导致世界末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will only cause Armageddon.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.07,1:13:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别听他的这一次会奏效的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't listen to him. This time, it will work!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.24,1:13:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能回去然后你就有无穷无尽的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will go back and you will have all the time in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.61,1:13:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你父亲在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}to spend with your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.61,1:13:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓杰我母亲去世的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danger, when my mom died,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.01,1:13:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我最痛苦的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was the worst thing that could ever happen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.48,1:13:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也希望能有更多时间和她在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wished I had more time with her.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.22,1:13:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有回头路\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no going back.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.69,1:13:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍惜你和他在一起的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honor the years you had with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.43,1:13:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些简短的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those brief…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.26,1:13:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,特殊的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}…special moments…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.66,1:14:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们会永远记住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…are the ones we'll remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.47,1:14:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键不在于你有多少时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about how much time you have.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.84,1:14:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,而在于你如何利用这些时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what you choose to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.34,1:14:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,末日倒计时20分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}T minus 20 minutes until Armageddon.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.71,1:14:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间漩涡打开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Time Vortex is opening!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.69,1:14:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么逃出我的沙漏的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you get outta my sand trap?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.39,1:14:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭着赤手空拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}With my bare hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.19,1:14:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是用我的自动唇膏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, it was my Atomic Lipstick.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.59,1:14:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我的继子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep away from my stepkids.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.96,1:14:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该说是你的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make that your kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.83,1:14:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.20,1:14:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该说是特工小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make that your Spy Kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.27,1:14:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我的特工小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away from my Spy Kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.81,1:14:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,来不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too late!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.39,1:15:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,奏效了奏效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked! It worked!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.03,1:15:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我们世界上的人都在固定中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone in the world is frozen except us.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.43,1:15:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And us.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.17,1:15:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Chronos!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.27,1:15:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别放开手表否则就会被定住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let go of the watch or you'll freeze!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.54,1:15:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须用项链\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to use the necklace.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.14,1:15:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,来永远停止末日装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}to stop the Armageddon device once and for all!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.98,1:15:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入漩涡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get into the Vortex.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.87,1:15:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等你没有锤子手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, you don't have your Hammer Hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.91,1:15:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要锤子手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need Hammer Hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.82,1:16:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 耶 - 塞西尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah! - Cecil!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.67,1:16:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂是玛丽萨送给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Marissa gave that to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.95,1:16:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别这么做邓杰 - 你无法找回过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't do it, Danger! - You can't bring back the past!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.92,1:16:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间是青春的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time is the enemy of youth.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.99,1:16:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找回我的青春\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting mine back.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.86,1:16:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会改变任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't change anything!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.06,1:17:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说不会改变任何事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said nothing would change.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.93,1:17:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.87,1:17:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.81,1:17:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是邓杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.38,1:17:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.32,1:17:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法回到从前\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't go back.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.29,1:17:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.79,1:17:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的父亲仍然死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father still died…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.46,1:17:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我如何去救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}…no matter what I tried to do to save him.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.03,1:17:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他告诉我一句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did tell me one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.04,1:18:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,很重要的一句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was very important.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.91,1:18:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,要好好生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to live life.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.38,1:18:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,向前看不是向后\N{\fnArial\fs30}moving forwards, not back.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.08,1:18:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.52,1:18:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会听他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm gonna listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.61,1:18:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.31,1:18:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marissa!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.75,1:18:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很担心你们你们怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was so worried about you guys. Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.15,1:18:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事 - 很抱歉把你们牵涉进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - I'm so sorry I brought you into this.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.25,1:18:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,史上最差的继母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worst stepmom ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.32,1:18:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.63,1:19:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是史上最棒的间谍妈妈我喜欢你本来的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But best spy mom ever! I like when you're being yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.77,1:19:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.64,1:19:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们以为阻止我了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you've stopped me?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.41,1:19:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们什么也没有阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've stopped nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.64,1:19:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会一遍遍的干下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just gonna keep doing this over and over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.68,1:19:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我得到我想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}until I get what I want!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.15,1:19:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这一次时间在我一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because this time, time is on my side!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.29,1:19:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的在监狱的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Hard time.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.53,1:19:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打倒你们了 - 哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Clocked ya. - Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.07,1:19:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你蒙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky punch!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.00,1:19:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么找到我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you find us?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.97,1:19:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是威尔伯你们的爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Wilbur Wilson, your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.64,1:19:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是最酷的爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the coolest dad ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.01,1:19:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会等着将来有足够的时间陪你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna wait until I have enough time for us to spend together.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.45,1:19:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,从今以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}From now on…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.69,1:19:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会挤出时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we're gonna make time.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.99,1:20:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是英雄气概\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that's heroic.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.80,1:20:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.87,1:20:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.84,1:20:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是间谍？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a spy?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.31,1:20:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的我是间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm a spy.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.01,1:20:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.15,1:20:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是间谍猎手\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm a Spy Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.08,1:20:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.32,1:20:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不会放你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm never letting go.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.86,1:20:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是家庭时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now this is family time.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.70,1:20:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和朱尼决定做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Juni and I have decided to become co-leaders.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.34,1:20:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的特工小子计划的共同负责人\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the new Spy Kids program.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.77,1:20:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要招兵买马\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need some new recruits.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.77,1:20:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,心灵手巧有创造力机智的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}with ingenuity, creativity, and heads-up thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.74,1:20:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽贝卡 塞西尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca, Cecil?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.51,1:20:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然还有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And of course…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.48,1:20:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,间谍宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Spy Baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.95,1:21:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝宝要给你们一个惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Baby's got a surprise for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.79,1:21:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别…这是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get… This is it, group, that's it. Just…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.29,1:21:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝宝会走路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby's first steps!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.03,1:21:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子走路有什么稀奇狗说话才稀奇呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're more impressed by a kid standing up than a dog that can talk?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.07,1:21:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on a second, l…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.01,1:21:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.07,1:21:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝宝打倒的第一个坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Baby's first bad guy!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.04,1:21:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇 - 是我教的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wow! - I taught her that.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.41,1:21:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.05,1:21:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有志不在年高嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you can never start 'em too young.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.62,1:21:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈真为你骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy's so proud of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.76,1:21:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的时间又回来了回到我们的快乐时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are back on the clock, back to taking our own sweet time.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.53,1:21:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,来笑来哭来拥抱我们所爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to laugh, to cry, to embrace our loved ones.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.90,1:21:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有无穷无尽的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have all the time in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.24,1:21:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}or do we?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.64,1:22:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,语音激活特工小子招募行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Voice activate. Operation Spy Kid Recruitment.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.98,1:22:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找天才儿童\N{\fnArial\fs30}Identifying possible talent.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.75,1:22:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,把过滤器调到最高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Setting filters to max.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.23,1:22:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被征召了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been activated.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.50,1:22:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也被征召了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have been activated.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.00,1:22:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在宣布你们是特工小子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I now declare you all Spy Kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.74,1:22:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢了一分\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one point for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.98,1:22:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}ouch.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.41,1:23:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers.
